      "message": "Thanks for coming out this CL. This looks good to me except for missing ipServer part:\nFor \"localOnly\" NCM tethering (used for mirrorlink), dhcp subnet(\"x\" of 192.168.x.y) will change if dhcp server received dhcp decline[1]. We should avoid this feature when ncm tethering is configure as global mode.\n\ne.g.\n    class BaseServingState extends State {\n-        @Override\n-        public void enter() {\n+        public void enter(boolean isGlobalMode) {\n            startConntrackMonitoring();\n\n            if (!startIPv4(isGlobalMode)) {\n                mLastError \u003d TetheringManager.TETHER_ERROR_IFACE_CFG_ERROR;\n                return;\n            }\n\n            try {\n                NetdUtils.tetherInterface(mNetd, mIfaceName, asIpPrefix(mIpv4Address));\n            } catch (RemoteException | ServiceSpecificException | IllegalStateException e) {\n                mLog.e(\"Error Tethering\", e);\n                mLastError \u003d TetheringManager.TETHER_ERROR_TETHER_IFACE_ERROR;\n                return;\n            }\n...\n   class LocalHotspotState extends BaseServingState {\n        @Override\n        public void enter() {\n-            super.enter();\n+            super.enter(false /** isGlobalMode */);\n            if (mLastError !\u003d TetheringManager.TETHER_ERROR_NO_ERROR) {\n                transitionTo(mInitialState);\n            }\n...\n    class TetheredState extends BaseServingState {\n        @Override\n        public void enter() {\n            super.enter();\n+            super.enter(true /** isGlobalMode */);\n            if (mLastError !\u003d TetheringManager.TETHER_ERROR_NO_ERROR) {\n                transitionTo(mInitialState);\n            }\n...\n    private boolean startIPv4(boolean isGlobalMode) {\n    private boolean configureIPv4(boolean enabled, boolean isGlobalMode) {\n    private boolean configureDhcp(boolean enable, final LinkAddress serverAddr,\n            final LinkAddress clientAddr, boolean isGlobalMode) {\n\n    private DhcpServingParamsParcel makeServingParams(@NonNull final Inet4Address defaultRouter,\n            @NonNull final Inet4Address dnsServer, @NonNull LinkAddress serverAddr,\n            @Nullable Inet4Address clientAddr, boolean isGlobalMode) {\n        final boolean changePrefixOnDecline \u003d\n-                (mInterfaceType \u003d\u003d TetheringManager.TETHERING_NCM \u0026\u0026 clientAddr \u003d\u003d null);\n+                (isGlobalMode \u0026\u0026 mInterfaceType \u003d\u003d TetheringManager.TETHERING_NCM \u0026\u0026 clientAddr \u003d\u003d null);\n\n\n[1] https://source.corp.google.com/aosp-master/packages/modules/Connectivity/Tethering/src/android/net/ip/IpServer.java;l\u003d527?q\u003dipserver.java\u0026sq\u003dpackage:aosp-master",
